%% Sequence 13 — System Admin comments on a reported dispute
%% Updated: 2026-07-28.
%% Scenario: an authenticated System Admin adds a governed comment from Board 5.
%% Evidence status: Implemented.
%% Boundary: the request stays under /api/admin/* and never enters a User/Organization/Project route.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor ADMIN as System Admin principal
    participant B as «boundary» Admin dispute board
    participant M as «boundary» System Admin middleware
    participant C as «boundary» CreateReviewDisputeCommentController
    participant K as «control» CreateReviewDisputeCommentCommand
    participant P as «control» Review dispute policy
    participant DB as «entity» PostgreSQL
    participant A as «control» Audit writer

    ADMIN->>B: Add case comment
    activate B
    B->>M: POST /api/admin/reviews/disputes/{id}/comments
    activate M
    M->>M: authenticate + requireSystemAdmin + bind System context
    alt Not a System Admin principal
        M-->>B: 401/403, no User-workspace redirect
    else Authorized System principal
        M->>C: handle(disputeId, body, visibility)
        activate C
        C->>K: execute(dto, System action context)
        activate K
        K->>DB: load dispute access context
        activate DB
        DB-->>K: dispute + System author context
        deactivate DB
        K->>P: canCommentOnReviewDispute(status, body, participant)
        P-->>K: allowed or denied
        alt Allowed
            K->>DB: insert comment in transaction
            activate DB
            K->>A: write critical audit record
            A-->>K: audit staged
            K->>DB: commit
            DB-->>K: comment
            deactivate DB
            K-->>C: created comment
            C-->>B: 201 comment
        else Denied
            K-->>C: policy error
            C-->>B: 4xx, state unchanged
        end
        deactivate K
        deactivate C
    end
    deactivate M
    B-->>ADMIN: Refresh case card room
    deactivate B
